        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rudolf Kjellén\n- People: Nazi geographer and ethnographer\n- Organizations: Nazi Party\n- Concepts: Blood and soil\n- Events: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- The slogan \"Blood and soil\" arose from this idea.\n- A Nazi geographer and ethnographer became notable for first using the term \"Blood and soil.\"\n- Rudolf Kjellén was influenced by the Nazi geographer and ethnographer.\n- The Nazi Party supported the concept's most extreme form until the end of World War II.",
