        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "f2e91d36-f6dd-56d8-bcdc-ca08e18a9dc3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Concepts: Blood and Soil, Lebensraum\n- Organizations: Nazi Party, Nazi Germany\n- People: Friedrich Ratzel, Rudolf Kjellén\n- Topics: German nationalism, World War II\n\nFacts:\n- Blood and Soil is a slogan expressing a nineteenth-century German idealization of a racially defined national body united with a settlement area.\n- Blood and Soil is tied to the German concept of Lebensraum, which held that the German people needed to reclaim historically German areas of Eastern Europe for expansion.\n- Friedrich Ratzel was a German geographer and ethnographer who lived from August 30, 1844 to August 9, 1904.\n- Friedrich Ratzel first used the term Lebensraum in a sense later adopted by the National Socialists.\n- Rudolf Kjellén's work was influenced by Friedrich Ratzel.\n- The Nazi Party and Nazi Germany supported the most extreme form of the Lebensraum ideology until the end of World War II.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "24aa4064-5d68-587d-ae15-9adebd543e8f",
        "text": "Page: Blood and Soil. Sentence: Blood and soil (German: \"Blut und Boden\" ) is a slogan expressing the nineteenth-century German idealization of a racially defined national body (\"blood\") united with a settlement area (\"soil\").\nPage: Blood and Soil. Sentence: The contemporary German concept Lebensraum, the belief that the German people needed to reclaim historically German areas of Eastern Europe into which they could expand, is tied to it.\nPage: Lebensraum. Sentence: The most extreme form of this ideology was supported by the Nazi Party (NSDAP) and Nazi Germany until the end of World War II.\nPage: Friedrich Ratzel. Sentence: Friedrich Ratzel (August 30, 1844 – August 9, 1904) was a German geographer and ethnographer, notable for first using the term \"Lebensraum\" (\"living space\") in the sense that the National Socialists later would.\nPage: Rudolf Kjellén. Sentence: His work was influenced by Friedrich Ratzel.",
        "type": "DocumentChunk"
